{"id":"fcde8ed3b263861a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-prop-jordan-decomposition.md","title":"Jordan Decomposition","display":"prop-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-jordan-decomposition","aliases":["58-prop-jordan-decomposition"],"display":"prop-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition","depends_on":["[[58-df-signed-measure]]","[[58-df-positive-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-jordan-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-jordan-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-jordan-decomposition — Jordan Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"58-df-signed-measure\">58-df-signed-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adc7a8154ed79d46\" href=\"?note=adc7a8154ed79d46\" title=\"58-df-positive-measure\">58-df-positive-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma)\">\\((X,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (measurable space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (finite signed measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma)\">\\((X,\\Sigma)\\)</span>; finiteness is stated explicitly below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\)</span> (signed measure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S\\)</span> (finite positive-measure predicate)</li>\n<li>Mutual singularity is expanded by a measurable partition in the Assertion</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)\\in\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists!\\langle\\mu^+,\\mu^-\\rangle\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)\\bigr)\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\Sigma\\;(P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land P\\cup N=X\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\land\\mu^-(P)=0)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)\\in\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists!\\langle\\mu^+,\\mu^-\\rangle\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)\\bigr)\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\Sigma\\;(P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land P\\cup N=X\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\land\\mu^-(P)=0)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The real-valued clause enforces the advertised finite signed-measure case; the upstream signed-measure predicate itself permits one-sided infinite values.</li>\n<li>Both Jordan parts are explicitly finite positive measures, and their difference is stated pointwise on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> rather than as an undeclared subtraction operation on function graphs.</li>\n<li>Uniqueness is for the ordered pair of mutually singular positive measures.</li>\n<li>The total variation is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mu|=\\mu^++\\mu^-\">\\(|\\mu|=\\mu^++\\mu^-\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-signed-measure","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-signed-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-positive-measure","status":"resolved","id":"adc7a8154ed79d46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-positive-measure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}jordan\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\mu(A)\\in\\mathbb R)\\to\\exists!\\langle\\mu^+,\\mu^-\\rangle\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^+,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteMeasure}_S(\\mu^-,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)=\\mu^+(A)-\\mu^-(A)\\bigr)\\land\\exists P,N\\in\\Sigma\\;(P\\cap N=\\emptyset\\land P\\cup N=X\\land\\mu^+(N)=0\\land\\mu^-(P)=0)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mu|=\\mu^++\\mu^-","display":false}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3970","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-prop-jordan-decomposition.md|58-prop-jordan-decomposition]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","adc7a8154ed79d46"]}